older":"Pratham Books","year":"2022"},{"page":7,"title":"Three children running in front of scooters","illustrator":"Siddhi Vartak","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2022"},{"page":8,"title":"Two children running in front of scooters","illustrator":"Siddhi Vartak","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2022"},{"page":9,"title":"Girl playing hide and seek","illustrator":"Siddhi Vartak","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2022"},{"page":10,"title":"A dog barking at two children who are playing","illustrator":"Siddhi Vartak","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2022"},{"page":11,"title":"Girl running through an alley while playing","illustrator":"Siddhi Vartak","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2022"},{"page":12,"title":"Pickle jars on the roof of a home","illustrator":"Siddhi Vartak","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2022"},{"page":13,"title":"A girl sneaking up on her friend","illustrator":"Siddhi Vartak","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2022"},{"page":14,"title":"Children hiding behind a wall","illustrator":"Siddhi Vartak","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2022"},{"page":15,"title":"Children huddled at the end of hide and seek game","illustrator":"Siddhi Vartak","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2022"}],"retrieved":"2026-09-25"},"pages":[{"n":1,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/481245-nanna-mane-endare/p01.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ನನ್ನ ಮನೆ ಎಂದರೆ, ಒಂದರ ಮೇಲೊಂದು ಇಟ್ಟ ಡಬ್ಬಿಯಂತೆ","ಎಲ್ಲಿ ನೋಡಿದರೂ ಕಿಟಕಿ, ಬಾಗಿಲುಗಳು.","ಹಾಂ, ಬಾಗಿಲು ನಮ್ಮ ಮನೆಗೇ ಸೇರಿದ್ದು.","ಆದರೆ, ನನ್ನ ಮನೆ ಸುತ್ತಲೂ ಹರಡಿಕೊಂಡಿದೆ.","ಇದು ನಮ್ಮ ಚಿಕ್ಕ ಫ್ಲಾಟ್‌ಗಿಂತ ತುಂಬಾ ದೊಡ್ಡದಾಗಿದೆ."]},{"n":2,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/481245-nanna-mane-endare/p02.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಬೆಳಕೋ ಬೆಳಕು ಮನೆಯಲ್ಲಿ, ಬಿಸಿಲಿದ್ದರೆ,"]},{"n":3,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/481245-nanna-mane-endare/p03.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಕತ್ತಲು ಮತ್ತು ಮಂಕು."]},{"n":4,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/481245-nanna-mane-endare/p04.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಕೆಲವೊಮ್ಮೆ ಒಣಗಿಸು,"]},{"n":5,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/481245-nanna-mane-endare/p05.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಕೆಲವೊಮ್ಮೆ ನೆನೆಯಿಸು."]},{"n":6,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/481245-nanna-mane-endare/p06.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಹಳದಿ, ಕೆಂಪು, ಗುಲಾಬಿ..."]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/481245-nanna-mane-endare/p07.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಹಸಿರಿನ ಅಷ್ಟೂ ಬಣ್ಣಗಳು."]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/481245-nanna-mane-endare/p08.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ನನ್ನ ಮನೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಒಮ್ಮೊಮ್ಮೆ","ಸೂಜಿ ಬಿದ್ದರೂ ಸದ್ದಾಗುವುದು,"]},{"n":9,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/481245-nanna-mane-endare/p09.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಆದರೆ, ಗದ್ದಲವೇ ಜಾಸ್ತಿ.","ಬೊಗಳುವ, ಗಂಟೆಯ,","ಹಾಡುವ ಸದ್ದು ಕೂಡ!"]},{"n":10,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/481245-nanna-mane-endare/p10.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ನಾಯಿ ಕಾಳ, ಪಕ್ಯಾ ಬಳಗದ ಕಾ ಕಾ,","ಮಾಯಾ ಮತ್ತದರ ಮರಿಗಳು ,","ನಿಮಗೆ ಕೇಳುತ್ತಿದೆಯ?"]},{"n":11,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/481245-nanna-mane-endare/p11.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಅಜ್ಜಿಯ ಉಪ್ಪಿನಕಾಯಿ,","ಅಳಿಲುಗಳ ಬಿಡುವಿಲ್ಲದ ಕಿಚಕಿಚ ಹರಟೆ ದೂಳು ಕವಿದ ಮಧ್ಯಾಹ್ನದ ಸೂರ್ಯ - ಇದೆಲ್ಲ ಸೇರಿ ಆಗಿದೆ ನನ್ನ ಮನೆ."]},{"n":12,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/481245-nanna-mane-endare/p12.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ನನ್ನ ಮನೆ ಎಂದರೆ"]},{"n":13,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/481245-nanna-mane-endare/p13.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಅಸ್ಮಿ, ಫಲಕ್, ರೋಶನ್, ಸಮಯ್, ಜಿಲ್‌ಮಿಲ್.","ಎಲ್ಲಿ ನೋಡಿದರೂ ಬಾಗಿಲುಗಳು","ಕಿಟಕಿಗಳು."]},{"n":14,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/481245-nanna-mane-endare/p14.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ನನ್ನ ಮನೆ ಎಂದರೆ, ಕಣ್ಣಾಮುಚ್ಚಾಲೆ ಆಟಕ್ಕೆ ಹೇಳಿ ಮಾಡಿಸಿದ್ದು!"]}],"wordCount":105}